{"created": "2022-08-09T14:20:48.566744+00:00", "modified": "2023-10-03T13:29:52.209806+00:00", "id": 6802614, "conceptrecid": "6802613", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.6802614", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.6802613", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6802614", "metadata": {"title": "Dataset with segmentations of 104 important anatomical structures in 1204 CT images", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.6802614", "publication_date": "2022-07-06", "description": "<p>In 1204 CT images we segmented 104 anatomical structures (27 organs, 59 bones, 10 muscles, 8 vessels) covering a majority of relevant classes for most use cases.&nbsp;The CT images were randomly sampled from clinical routine, thus representing a real world dataset which generalizes to clinical application. The dataset contains a wide range of different pathologies, scanners, sequences and institutions.</p>\n\n<p>You can find a segmentation model trained on this dataset <a href=\"https://github.com/wasserth/TotalSegmentator\">here</a>.</p>\n\n<p>More details about the dataset can be found in the corresponding <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.05868\">paper</a>. Please cite this paper if you use the dataset.</p>\n\n<p>This dataset was created by the department of <a href=\"https://www.unispital-basel.ch/en/radiologie-nuklearmedizin/forschung-radiologie-nuklearmedizin\">Research and Analysis at University Hospital Basel</a>.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Jakob Wasserthal", "affiliation": "University Hospital Basel"}], "keywords": ["CT image, medical image segmentation, deep learning, organ segmentation"], "version": "1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": false, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "6802613"}}]}}, "title": "Dataset with segmentations of 104 important anatomical structures in 1204 CT images", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/6802614", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/6802614?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6802614", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6802614", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.6802614", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802613", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/6802613", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6802613", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.6802613", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:6802614/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:6802614/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/6802614/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/6802614/requests"}, "updated": "2023-10-03T13:29:52.209806+00:00", "recid": "680261